{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R8PWsZptTT6yUVb2KbTpLF","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Issue 5: Chainsaw rule\n2\t\n3\t## Outcome\n4\t\n5\tOnly members who did the induction for the chainsaw's safety class (class C) can borrow it.\n6\tOther members are told why they cannot.\n7\t\n8\t## Requirements\n9\t\n10\t- When a member without the \"C\" induction asks to borrow a class C item, the system shall refuse and give a reason that names the induction.\n11\t- Where a member has the \"C\" induction, the system shall let them borrow a free class C item.\n12\t- When a member holds only other inductions, such as \"B\", the system shall still refuse a class C item.\n13\t- While an item is class A or class B, the system shall decide as before, without needing an induction.\n14\t- If a class C item is in repair or already out, the system shall refuse it even when the member has the \"C\" induction.\n15\t\n16\t## Must not change\n17\t\n18\t- Anything under `src/auth/`.\n19\t- The refusal for a tool in repair or already out, and its reasons.\n20\t- The existing tests.\n21\t- Money stays in integer cents.\n22\t\n23\t## Out of scope\n24\t\n25\t- Recording or granting inductions.\n26\t- Rules for class B tools.\n27\t- Changes to the desk screens or the server routes.\n28\t\n29\t## Done when\n30\t\n31\t- The new tests in `tests/items/borrow.test.ts` pass.\n32\t- `bun run gate` exits 0.\n33\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b0446e6c-9495-4839-b208-0fa5fcea2376","uuid":"0ca37098-516b-47bf-b901-d18940680fc7","timestamp":"2026-11-13T05:09:41.819Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/user/software-factory-claude-code/parts/06-price-and-ship/03-ship-the-factory/solution/runs/5/repo/specs/5/SPEC.md","content":"# Issue 5: Chainsaw rule\n\n## Outcome\n\nOnly members who did the induction for the chainsaw's safety class (class C) can borrow it.\nOther members are told why they cannot.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- When a member without the \"C\" induction asks to borrow a class C item, the system shall refuse and give a reason that names the induction.\n- Where a member has the \"C\" induction, the system shall let them borrow a free class C item.\n- When a member holds only other inductions, such as \"B\", the system shall still refuse a class C item.\n- While an item is class A or class B, the system shall decide as before, without needing an induction.\n- If a class C item is in repair or already out, the system shall refuse it even when the member has the \"C\" induction.\n\n## Must not change\n\n- Anything under `src/auth/`.\n- The refusal for a tool in repair or already out, and its reasons.\n- The existing tests.\n- Money stays in integer cents.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Recording or granting inductions.\n- Rules for class B tools.\n- Changes to the desk screens or the server routes.\n\n## Done when\n\n- The new tests in `tests/items/borrow.test.ts` pass.\n- `bun run gate` exits 0.\n","numLines":33,"startLine":1,"totalLines":33}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01R8PWsZptTT6yUVb2KbTpLF","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
